HyperSpring UI adaptation
-------------------------
The companion's TabReveal glass-wave transition is adapted from
olilio3/HyperSpring (https://github.com/olilio3/HyperSpring),
Copyright 2026 HyperSpring contributors, Apache License 2.0.
The full Apache-2.0 license is retained in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.
Eclipse changes include per-Activity animation ownership, outgoing snapshots
instead of live hidden fragments, bounded snapshot allocation, reduced-motion
handling and restoration of view properties. Companion palette and navigation
motion are inspired by HyperSpring's SettingsActivity, Motion and GlassBar;
Eclipse keeps its own accessible tab views and existing glass rendering backends.
No HyperSpring launcher or System UI hooks are included.
